{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方\n初めて読んでくださった方\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ナチュラルハイ／ふう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近のお気に入りはボーロちゃん。\nこんばんまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/10/7603916/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/10/7603916/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑学園祭のとき\n口元のほくろがよく見えるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から朝から\nいろいろ撮影してました。\n疲れてるのにまだ目が\nぱっちりしております"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/10/7603916/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふっふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"0時過ぎちゃったけど、\n明日は岡山イベント！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ楽しみです！\n2回もライブできるの嬉しいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型どうしよ。\nまあまた汗でぐちゃぐちゃに\nなるだろう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/10/7603916/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/10/7603916/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんとまりっかのうしろに\n写ってるのはだーれだ笑\n難しいかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/10/7603916/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、寝る！\nおやすみなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}